If a patient has a moderate-to-severe-chronic-back-pain then an acetaminophen-or-NSAID-first-nonopioid-strategy outperforms an opioid-first-strategy in a pain-intensity-improvement and outperforms an opioid-first-strategy in a side-effect-reduction.
If a patient has a moderate-to-severe-hip-or-knee-osteoarthritis-pain then an acetaminophen-or-NSAID-first-nonopioid-strategy outperforms an opioid-first-strategy in a pain-intensity-improvement and outperforms an opioid-first-strategy in a side-effect-reduction.
